-- 146a. s 38(1): subsidiary legislation that was not in operation immediately before: does not continue
#ASSERT `the subsidiary legislation continues in operation as if made under the repealing Act` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 146b. s 38(1): subsidiary legislation inconsistent with the repealing Act: does not continue
#ASSERT `the subsidiary legislation continues in operation as if made under the repealing Act` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 147. s 38(2): continued subsidiary legislation may be amended or repealed as if made under the new Act
#ASSERT `the continuing subsidiary legislation may be amended or repealed as if made under the repealing Act` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- 148. s 38(1): an Act that repeals without substituting or re-enacting does not continue the subsidiary legislation
#ASSERT `the subsidiary legislation continues in operation as if made under the repealing Act` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
